  "description": "Located on the top floor of the Landmark Amman Hotel and recently voted the most romantic restaurant in Amman! We offer the most delicious made to order mouthwatering Sushi around! We are inspired by the Japanese legend of Senbazuru, that promises anyone who folds 1,000 origami cranes the chance to be granted a wish. So we teach our customers to fold origami cranes and for every 100 cranes folded, a child in need gets granted a wish. Become part of the legend! Fold a crane and help make a dream come true.",
